<title>GERMANY: GERMAN TRADE SEEKS INTERVENTION RYE EXPORTS.</title>
<headline>GERMAN TRADE SEEKS INTERVENTION RYE EXPORTS.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>German grain traders placed bids for the export of 33,330 tonnes of intervention rye to third countries, state grain intervention board BLE said.</p>
<p>The bids will be discussed at the EU cereals management committee meeting later on Thursday.</p>
<p>-Hamburg newsroom, +49-40-41903275</p>
</text>
